  "docs": {
    "description": "Inline group of 2–5 mutually exclusive segments, with an optional field label and helper so it can sit in a form. 2 variants: size (sm, md). Booleans show helper, show mandatory; label and helper are text props; Track is a slot for Segmented Control Item instances. Behaves as a radio group: commits on click, one segment always selected. For 6+ options or URL-level navigation use Tabs; for on/off use Toggle.",
    "figmaIssues": []
  },
